---@field pass datamunge.HullPass Producing scan direction.
---@field action datamunge.HullAction Actual test, pop or push.
---@field candidate integer Pending sorted unique point.
---@field point integer Actual edited point, or candidate for a test.
---@field a integer Test's next-to-top point; otherwise zero placeholder.
---@field b integer Test's top point; otherwise zero placeholder.
---@field turn integer Exact test sign -1,0,+1; otherwise zero placeholder.
---@field stack_size integer Size immediately after this event.
