---
---**Example**
---
---```cpp
---auto plt = dm::Plot().lines(dm::c(0.0, 1.0, 2.0), dm::c(0.0, 1.0, 0.0), dm::RGB{0, 0, 0}, 1.0);
---std::print("{}\n", plt.series()[0].label.empty());  // true
---```
---
---**Errors** (raised as Lua errors)
