---```cpp
---const auto x = dm::seql(0.0, 6.0, 30);
---dm::graphics::RLayout::create(1, 2)
---    .add(dm::Plot(x, dm::sin(x)))
---    .add(dm::Plot(x, dm::cos(x)))
---    .show("Trig");
---```
---
---**Errors** (raised as Lua errors)
---* `std::runtime_error`: If X11 support was not enabled at build time or no display is available.
---* `std::invalid_argument`: If no panel was added.
---
---See also: `save()`, `Plot::show()`
---@param title_hint? string Window title; empty (the default) uses title_text(). (default: `""`)
function datamunge.RLayout:show(title_hint) end

