---Read the deferred result's column count without evaluating.
---@return integer # Number of columns.
function datamunge.LinalgMatrix:cols() end

---Inspect the deferred result's storage policy without evaluating.
---@return boolean # True for CSR results; inverse actions and solves return dense results.
