---@param other datamunge.LinalgMatrix Right operand, retained by shared ownership.
---@return datamunge.LinalgMatrix # Deferred product or solve handle.
function datamunge.LinalgMatrix:multiply(other) end

---Form a deferred square inverse action, without factorisation or inversion.
---Multiplication turns this into a solve; evaluating it alone forms an explicit inverse.
---
---**Example**
---
---```cpp
---dm::LinalgMatrix A({2}, 1, 1);
---std::print("{:.1f}\n", A.inverse_action().values()[0]); // 0.5
---```
---
---**Errors** (raised as Lua errors)
---* `std::invalid_argument`: If this matrix is not square.
---@return datamunge.LinalgMatrix # Deferred inverse-action handle.
function datamunge.LinalgMatrix:inverse_action() end

---Evaluate a square system with LU or a tall least-squares system with QR.
