---**Errors** (raised as Lua errors)
---* `std::invalid_argument`: For nonfinite solve inputs.
---* `std::runtime_error`: For singular or rank-deficient systems.
---@return datamunge.LinalgMatrix # Materialised matrix handle, sharing immutable storage when already concrete.
function datamunge.LinalgMatrix:eval() end

