---Everything a BayesianOptimization::run() evaluated, in order.
---@class datamunge.BayesianOptimizationResult
---@field best_point number[] The evaluated point with the smallest value.
---@field best_value number The smallest observed value.
---@field points number[][] Every evaluated point: the initial design first, then one per iteration.
---@field values number[] The objective value at each point.
