---```cpp
---dm::optim::EqualityQuadratic f({2,0},1);
---dm::optim::SQPOptions controls;controls.max_iterations=5;
---std::vector<double> x{0,0};
---const auto value=dm::optim::SQP(controls).optimize(f,x);
---std::print("{}\n",std::isfinite(value)); // true
---```
