---@class datamunge.TrustRegionNewtonOptions
---@field initial_radius number Positive starting Cauchy-step radius. Default 1.0.
---@field max_radius number Maximum radius after successful Cauchy steps. Default 1000.0.
---@field max_iterations integer Maximum native iterations/epochs as described by optimize(); zero performs no updates. Default 200.
---@field tolerance number Stopping threshold; its actual gradient/change/displacement/scale meaning is method-specific. Default 1e-8.
