---@field parameter1 number Primary df or count parameter; consult the test contract.
---@field parameter2 number Secondary df/count parameter where used; otherwise zero.
---@field p_value number Null-reference p-value, not adjusted for multiple testing.
---@field estimate1 number First test-specific estimate, such as a mean, ratio or correlation.
---@field estimate2 number Second estimate when applicable, such as a second group mean.
---@field conf_int_lower number Lower confidence bound, meaningful only when has_conf_int.
---@field conf_int_upper number Upper confidence bound, meaningful only when has_conf_int.
---@field has_conf_int boolean Whether confidence bounds were computed for this result.
---@field alternative datamunge.Alternative Tail requested by the caller.
---@field method string Owned human-readable method, including relevant approximation labels.
