---**Example**
---
---```cpp
---const auto pairs = dm::Splom(dm::datasets::iris(), {"Sepal.Length", "Sepal.Width"});
---pairs.panel(1, 0).save("sepal_scatter.svg");  // Sepal.Length on x, Sepal.Width on y
---```
---
---**Errors** (raised as Lua errors)
---* `std::out_of_range`: If either index is not below variables().size().
---* `std::invalid_argument`: If the panel has no complete rows to draw.
---@param row integer Zero-based index of the y variable.
---@param col integer Zero-based index of the x variable; equal to `row` gives the diagonal panel.
---@return datamunge.RPlot # The rendered-on-demand panel plot.
