---SWIG-friendly facade for datamunge::autodiff::Dual -- a first-order forward-mode
---dual number. Build an expression out of named operations (starting from a seed
---with derivative=1) to read off an exact derivative alongside the value.
---@class datamunge.Dual
---@overload fun(value: number, derivative?: number): datamunge.Dual
datamunge.Dual = {}

---The real part: the function value.
---@return number
function datamunge.Dual:value() end

---The dual part: the exact derivative with respect to the seed.
---@return number
function datamunge.Dual:derivative() end

---Sum: this + `other`, with derivative a' + b'.
---@param other datamunge.Dual Right operand.
---@return datamunge.Dual # A new Dual; neither operand changes.
function datamunge.Dual:add(other) end

---Difference: this - `other`, with derivative a' - b'.
---@param other datamunge.Dual Right operand.
---@return datamunge.Dual # A new Dual; neither operand changes.
function datamunge.Dual:subtract(other) end

---Product: this * `other`, with derivative a'b + ab' (product rule).
---@param other datamunge.Dual Right operand.
---@return datamunge.Dual # A new Dual; neither operand changes.
function datamunge.Dual:multiply(other) end

---Quotient: this / `other`, with derivative (a'b - ab')/b² (IEEE inf/NaN when other is 0).
---@param other datamunge.Dual Right operand.
---@return datamunge.Dual # A new Dual; neither operand changes.
function datamunge.Dual:divide(other) end

---Negation -x, with its exact chain-rule derivative.
---@return datamunge.Dual # A new Dual.
function datamunge.Dual:negate() end

---Adds a constant `scalar`, derivative unchanged.
---@param scalar number Constant right operand.
---@return datamunge.Dual # A new Dual.
function datamunge.Dual:add_scalar(scalar) end

---Subtracts a constant `scalar`, derivative unchanged.
---@param scalar number Constant right operand.
---@return datamunge.Dual # A new Dual.
function datamunge.Dual:subtract_scalar(scalar) end

---Multiplies by a constant `scalar`, derivative scaled by it.
---@param scalar number Constant right operand.
---@return datamunge.Dual # A new Dual.
function datamunge.Dual:multiply_scalar(scalar) end

---Divides by a constant `scalar`, derivative divided by it.
