---```
---
---**Errors** (raised as Lua errors)
---* `std::out_of_range`: For invalid levels/indices.
---* `std::invalid_argument`: On a dimension mismatch.
---@param level integer Level.
---@param index integer[] Multi-index.
---@return boolean # Activity flag.
function datamunge.TruncatedHierarchicalBSpline:is_active(level, index) end

